                                                "sense_id": "f166e720-c18d-37fe-97d5-17cb2cacfe98",
                                                "text": "In a consumerist hypersexualized environment where bare-midriffed fifteen-year-olds are the pedophilic standard of desirability, becoming older is coded as a set of deficiencies."
